{"id":"77d1a531e7662d98","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-calculus-of-constructions.md","title":"Calculus of Constructions","display":"df-calculus-of-constructions — Calculus of Constructions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-calculus-of-constructions","aliases":["72-df-calculus-of-constructions"],"display":"df-calculus-of-constructions — Calculus of Constructions","depends_on":["[[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]","[[72-df-types-inference-closure]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified","source_location":"Supplement: Coquand–Huet, The Calculus of Constructions, INRIA RR-0530 (1986), §§1–3, print1–8/PDF4–11, https://www.asc.ohio-state.edu/pollard.4/type/readings/coc88.pdf (actual report version; modern two-sort PTS reconstruction); Handbook X print692/PDF704; bibliography print776/PDF788","source_kind":"supplementary-primary-source-with-local-PTS-reconstruction","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","proof_status":"local structural construction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-calculus-of-constructions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-calculus-of-constructions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-calculus-of-constructions — Calculus of Constructions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" href=\"?note=3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" title=\"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction\">72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a77f51439d01d542\" href=\"?note=a77f51439d01d542\" title=\"72-df-types-inference-closure\">72-df-types-inference-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplement: Coquand–Huet, The Calculus of Constructions, INRIA RR-0530 (1986), §§1–3, print1–8/PDF4–11, <a href=\"https://www.asc.ohio-state.edu/pollard.4/type/readings/coc88.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.asc.ohio-state.edu/pollard.4/type/readings/coc88.pdf</a> (actual report version; modern two-sort PTS reconstruction); Handbook X print692/PDF704; bibliography print776/PDF788"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"supplementary-primary-source-with-local-PTS-reconstruction"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local structural construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\in\\mathsf C\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\in\\mathsf C\\)</span> 是不同原始常元，常元集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf C\">\\(\\mathsf C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_t\">\\(V_t\\)</span>、原始语法及诱导的避免捕获代入、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_C\">\\(\\beta_C\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=_{\\beta_C}\">\\(=_{\\beta_C}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" href=\"?note=3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" title=\"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction\">72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction</a>。下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_n\">\\(E_n\\)</span> 只含原始树；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_C\">\\(\\mathcal E_C\\)</span> 是它们在同一上游 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 商中的像。规则中的构造子指诱导商运算；变量在项位置缩写其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 类，常元在 sort 和判断位置也缩写其原始树的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 类。</li>\n<li>上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 遍历下式构造的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ctx}_C\">\\(\\operatorname{Ctx}_C\\)</span>；它允许尚未证实良构的声明序列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\)</span> 是下式定义的两类判断编码，在规则分数内也表示该编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_C\">\\(U_C\\)</span> 由这两类编码的集合并构造。规则及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cl}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cl}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a77f51439d01d542\" href=\"?note=a77f51439d01d542\" title=\"72-df-types-inference-closure\">72-df-types-inference-closure</a>；所有新扩充变量不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,A,B\">\\(M,N,A,B\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_C\">\\(\\mathcal E_C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_t\">\\(V_t\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>在长度函数的定义式中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 遍历全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(V_t\\times\\mathcal E_C)^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\((V_t\\times\\mathcal E_C)^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，有限序列采用函数编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 表示唯一描述。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_0\">\\(\\pi_0\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_t\\times\\mathcal E_C\">\\(V_t\\times\\mathcal E_C\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,x:A\">\\(\\Gamma,x:A\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x:A\\in\\Gamma\">\\(x:A\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 使用下式的序列扩充及成员谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 专指声明的变量集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nE_0&amp;:=V_t\\cup\\{\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\},\\\\\nE_{n+1}&amp;:=E_n\\cup\\{MN:M,N\\in E_n\\}\\cup\\{\\lambda x:A.M,\\Pi x:A.M:x\\in V_t,A,M\\in E_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal E_C&amp;:=\\{[M]_\\alpha:M\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}E_n\\},\\qquad\\mathcal S_C:=\\{\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal A_C&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\rangle\\},\\qquad\\mathcal R_C:=\\mathcal S_C\\times\\mathcal S_C.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nE_0&amp;:=V_t\\cup\\{\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\},\\\\\nE_{n+1}&amp;:=E_n\\cup\\{MN:M,N\\in E_n\\}\\cup\\{\\lambda x:A.M,\\Pi x:A.M:x\\in V_t,A,M\\in E_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal E_C&amp;:=\\{[M]_\\alpha:M\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}E_n\\},\\qquad\\mathcal S_C:=\\{\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal A_C&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\rangle\\},\\qquad\\mathcal R_C:=\\mathcal S_C\\times\\mathcal S_C.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{lh}(\\Gamma)&amp;:=\\iota n\\in\\omega\\ (\\Gamma\\in(V_t\\times\\mathcal E_C)^n),\\\\\n\\pi_0(\\langle x,A\\rangle)&amp;:=x\\quad(x\\in V_t,\\ A\\in\\mathcal E_C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ctx}_C&amp;:=\\{\\Gamma\\in(V_t\\times\\mathcal E_C)^{&lt;\\omega}:\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(\\Gamma)\\ (\\pi_0(\\Gamma_i)\\ne\\pi_0(\\Gamma_j))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)&amp;:=\\{x\\in V_t:\\exists i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists A\\in\\mathcal E_C\\ (\\Gamma_i=\\langle x,A\\rangle)\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma,x:A&amp;:=\\Gamma^\\frown\\langle\\langle x,A\\rangle\\rangle\\quad(x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)),\\\\\nx:A\\in\\Gamma&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\langle x,A\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma),\\\\\n(\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark)&amp;:=\\langle0,\\Gamma\\rangle,\\\\\n(\\Gamma\\vdash M:A)&amp;:=\\langle1,\\langle\\Gamma,M,A\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\nU_C&amp;:=\\{\\langle0,\\Gamma\\rangle:\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_C\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle1,\\langle\\Gamma,M,A\\rangle\\rangle:\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_C,\\ M,A\\in\\mathcal E_C\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{lh}(\\Gamma)&amp;:=\\iota n\\in\\omega\\ (\\Gamma\\in(V_t\\times\\mathcal E_C)^n),\\\\\n\\pi_0(\\langle x,A\\rangle)&amp;:=x\\quad(x\\in V_t,\\ A\\in\\mathcal E_C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ctx}_C&amp;:=\\{\\Gamma\\in(V_t\\times\\mathcal E_C)^{&lt;\\omega}:\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(\\Gamma)\\ (\\pi_0(\\Gamma_i)\\ne\\pi_0(\\Gamma_j))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)&amp;:=\\{x\\in V_t:\\exists i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists A\\in\\mathcal E_C\\ (\\Gamma_i=\\langle x,A\\rangle)\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma,x:A&amp;:=\\Gamma^\\frown\\langle\\langle x,A\\rangle\\rangle\\quad(x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)),\\\\\nx:A\\in\\Gamma&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\langle x,A\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma),\\\\\n(\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark)&amp;:=\\langle0,\\Gamma\\rangle,\\\\\n(\\Gamma\\vdash M:A)&amp;:=\\langle1,\\langle\\Gamma,M,A\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\nU_C&amp;:=\\{\\langle0,\\Gamma\\rangle:\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_C\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle1,\\langle\\Gamma,M,A\\rangle\\rangle:\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_C,\\ M,A\\in\\mathcal E_C\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nR_C:=&amp;\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\langle\\rangle\\vdash\\checkmark}\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{Prop}:\\mathsf{Type}}\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A:s}{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash\\checkmark}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\right\\}\n\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark}{\\Gamma\\vdash x:A}:x:A\\in\\Gamma\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B:s}{\\Gamma,x:B\\vdash M:A}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A:s_1\\quad\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash B:s_2}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\Pi x:A.B:s_2}:\\langle s_1,s_2\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R_C\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash M:B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash\\Pi x:A.B:s}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda x:A.M:\\Pi x:A.B}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:\\Pi x:A.B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash N:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash MN:B[N/x]}\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B:s}{\\Gamma\\vdash M:B}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\land A=_{\\beta_C}B\\right\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_C\\checkmark&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark)\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_C}(R_C),\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_C M:A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma\\vdash M:A)\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_C}(R_C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CoC}&amp;:=\\langle\\mathcal E_C,\\mathcal S_C,\\mathcal A_C,\\mathcal R_C,R_C\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nR_C:=&amp;\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\langle\\rangle\\vdash\\checkmark}\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{Prop}:\\mathsf{Type}}\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A:s}{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash\\checkmark}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\right\\}\n\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark}{\\Gamma\\vdash x:A}:x:A\\in\\Gamma\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B:s}{\\Gamma,x:B\\vdash M:A}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A:s_1\\quad\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash B:s_2}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\Pi x:A.B:s_2}:\\langle s_1,s_2\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R_C\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash M:B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash\\Pi x:A.B:s}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda x:A.M:\\Pi x:A.B}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:\\Pi x:A.B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash N:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash MN:B[N/x]}\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B:s}{\\Gamma\\vdash M:B}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\land A=_{\\beta_C}B\\right\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_C\\checkmark&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark)\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_C}(R_C),\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_C M:A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma\\vdash M:A)\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_C}(R_C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CoC}&amp;:=\\langle\\mathcal E_C,\\mathcal S_C,\\mathcal A_C,\\mathcal R_C,R_C\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>2026-10-23载体补全：上下文先作为无重复变量的有限语法序列构造，是否良构再由规则闭包判定。两个自然数标签使上下文判断与类型判断互不相交；编码不要求输入判断已经可导。所有规则的前提与结论均落在同一集合载体中，原有sort、公理、product与转换规则保持不变。有限序列、积与并均为ZFC集合构造，无须另选外部判断全集。</p>\n<p>这里给出经典CoC的二sort PTS呈现，四对product sort全部允许；旧稿漏掉的(Prop,Type)会排除依赖于项的类型族。Type没有更高sort公理，特别没有Type:Type。此处不把本书Nuprl体系等同于CoC。实际核看的链接PDF为Coquand–Huet的1986年INRIA报告RR-0530，封面另有HAL收录信息；网址中的coc88不能作为1988期刊版身份的证据。报告以de Bruijn对象/上下文及带判断的转换同余给规则；这里以Prop对应报告的*、Type表示不可再类型化的kind层，并使用带名α类和未类型化β转换，给出现代二sort PTS局部定义。本次未建立两种呈现逐推导双向翻译，亦未把报告受限转换演算的性质直接移植过来。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"3cb0b5b1c6108aea","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-types-inference-closure","status":"resolved","id":"a77f51439d01d542","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-types-inference-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"3cb0b5b1c6108aea","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\in\\mathsf C$ 是不同原始常元，常元集合 $\\mathsf C$、$V_t$、原始语法及诱导的避免捕获代入、$\\beta_C$ 和 $=_{\\beta_C}$ 见 [[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]。下式 $E_n$ 只含原始树；$\\mathcal E_C$ 是它们在同一上游 $\\alpha$ 商中的像。规则中的构造子指诱导商运算；变量在项位置缩写其 $\\alpha$ 类，常元在 sort 和判断位置也缩写其原始树的 $\\alpha$ 类。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-types-inference-closure","status":"resolved","id":"a77f51439d01d542","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"上下文 $\\Gamma$ 遍历下式构造的 $\\operatorname{Ctx}_C$；它允许尚未证实良构的声明序列。$\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark$ 与 $\\Gamma\\vdash M:A$ 是下式定义的两类判断编码，在规则分数内也表示该编码。$U_C$ 由这两类编码的集合并构造。规则及 $\\operatorname{Cl}$ 使用 [[72-df-types-inference-closure]]；所有新扩充变量不在 $\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma$；$M,N,A,B$ 遍历 $\\mathcal E_C$，$x$ 遍历 $V_t$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\in\\mathsf C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf C","display":false},{"tex":"V_t","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_C","display":false},{"tex":"=_{\\beta_C}","display":false},{"tex":"E_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ctx}_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash M:A","display":false},{"tex":"U_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"M,N,A,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_C","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"V_t","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"(V_t\\times\\mathcal E_C)^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_0","display":false},{"tex":"V_t\\times\\mathcal E_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,x:A","display":false},{"tex":"x:A\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nE_0&:=V_t\\cup\\{\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\},\\\\\nE_{n+1}&:=E_n\\cup\\{MN:M,N\\in E_n\\}\\cup\\{\\lambda x:A.M,\\Pi x:A.M:x\\in V_t,A,M\\in E_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal E_C&:=\\{[M]_\\alpha:M\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}E_n\\},\\qquad\\mathcal S_C:=\\{\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal A_C&:=\\{\\langle\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\rangle\\},\\qquad\\mathcal R_C:=\\mathcal S_C\\times\\mathcal S_C.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{lh}(\\Gamma)&:=\\iota n\\in\\omega\\ (\\Gamma\\in(V_t\\times\\mathcal E_C)^n),\\\\\n\\pi_0(\\langle x,A\\rangle)&:=x\\quad(x\\in V_t,\\ A\\in\\mathcal E_C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ctx}_C&:=\\{\\Gamma\\in(V_t\\times\\mathcal E_C)^{<\\omega}:\\forall i<j<\\operatorname{lh}(\\Gamma)\\ (\\pi_0(\\Gamma_i)\\ne\\pi_0(\\Gamma_j))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)&:=\\{x\\in V_t:\\exists i<\\operatorname{lh}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists A\\in\\mathcal E_C\\ (\\Gamma_i=\\langle x,A\\rangle)\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma,x:A&:=\\Gamma^\\frown\\langle\\langle x,A\\rangle\\rangle\\quad(x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)),\\\\\nx:A\\in\\Gamma&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\langle x,A\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma),\\\\\n(\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark)&:=\\langle0,\\Gamma\\rangle,\\\\\n(\\Gamma\\vdash M:A)&:=\\langle1,\\langle\\Gamma,M,A\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\nU_C&:=\\{\\langle0,\\Gamma\\rangle:\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_C\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle1,\\langle\\Gamma,M,A\\rangle\\rangle:\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_C,\\ M,A\\in\\mathcal E_C\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nR_C:=&\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\langle\\rangle\\vdash\\checkmark}\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{Prop}:\\mathsf{Type}}\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A:s}{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash\\checkmark}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\right\\}\n\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark}{\\Gamma\\vdash x:A}:x:A\\in\\Gamma\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B:s}{\\Gamma,x:B\\vdash M:A}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A:s_1\\quad\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash B:s_2}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\Pi x:A.B:s_2}:\\langle s_1,s_2\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R_C\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash M:B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash\\Pi x:A.B:s}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda x:A.M:\\Pi x:A.B}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:\\Pi x:A.B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash N:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash MN:B[N/x]}\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B:s}{\\Gamma\\vdash M:B}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\land A=_{\\beta_C}B\\right\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_C\\checkmark&:\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark)\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_C}(R_C),\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_C M:A&:\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma\\vdash M:A)\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_C}(R_C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CoC}&:=\\langle\\mathcal E_C,\\mathcal S_C,\\mathcal A_C,\\mathcal R_C,R_C\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":6140,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-438","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-calculus-of-constructions|df-calculus-of-constructions — Calculus of Constructions]]"}],"outgoing":["3cb0b5b1c6108aea","a77f51439d01d542"]}